{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Cliques"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"enumerated()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:STsE10enumerateds18EnumeratedSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","extendedModule":"Swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/enumerated()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/enumerated()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.enumerated()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/enumerated()":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/enumerated()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/enumerated()","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"enumerated()","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","abstract":[],"role":"collection","title":"Cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","title":"MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]}}}